sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Lambda as Agent Lambda
    participant DDB as DynamoDB
    participant Bedrock as Amazon Bedrock
    participant Tools as Tool Registry

    User->>API: POST /agent/query
    API->>Lambda: Invoke handler
    Lambda->>DDB: Load state
    Lambda->>Bedrock: Request next action
    Bedrock-->>Lambda: Structured JSON action
    Lambda->>Tools: Execute validated tool call
    Tools-->>Lambda: Tool result
    Lambda->>DDB: Persist state
    Lambda-->>API: Final answer
    API-->>User: Response
